    "* **Encoder/Decoder** convert text to numbers, but they do not know what the numbers mean.\n",
    "* **`nn.Embedding(vocab_size, vocab_size)`** is a lookup table mapping current tokens (rows) to next tokens (columns).\n",
    "* **Logits** are the raw, unadjusted popularity votes stored inside this grid for every possible next token.\n",
    "* **Forward Pass** takes your input integer and pulls out its specific row of votes from the table.\n",
    "* **`.view()`** flattens the 3D data grid into a 2D matrix so the loss function can read it.\n",
    "* **`F.cross_entropy`** compares the model's raw votes against the actual correct target numbers.\n",
    "* **Loss** is the final penalty score used by PyTorch to tweak the table's numbers until it guesses right.\n"
