    "### This is the simplest possible Model we build - a BigramLanguageModel where each new tokens is predicted on the basis of just the previous token. Thus to improve this we need to make sure that there's a context where each tokens can interact with each other not just the previous one to build logits.  It reached its absolute mathematical limit because it only looks at one character of context."
